  (text "BLOCK 1: 6-POLIGES MILL-MAX POGO-INTERFACE / M8 RUNDSTECKER:\n- Pin 1: POD3_VCC (5.0V DC Versorgung ueber Zentralbox)\n- Pin 2: POD3_GND (Dedizierte Power- & Signalmasse)\n- Pin 3: POD3_UART_TX (Heck ESP32-C3 -> Zentralbox ESP32-S3 @ 460.800 Baud)\n- Pin 4: POD3_UART_RX (Zentralbox ESP32-S3 -> Heck ESP32-C3 @ 460.800 Baud)\n- Pin 5: POD3_GNSS_PPS (1-PPS Hardware-Zeitnormal Sync an ESP32-S3 GPIO 21)\n- Pin 6: POD3_1WIRE_ID (DS2401 Silicon Serial Number)" (at 25.4 90.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  )

  (text "BLOCK 2: ESP32-C3 CO-PROZESSOR (PRIMARY 2.4 GHz MESH PHY):\n- Sendet & empfaengt 2.4 GHz Primary High-Speed Mesh (IEEE 802.15.4 / SC-FDMA, Opus 24k)\n- UART0: High-Speed Bridge zur Zentralbox (TX GPIO 21, RX GPIO 20 @ 460.800 Baud)\n- UART1: Interface zum MAX-M10S (TX GPIO 4, RX GPIO 5 @ 115.200 Baud / UBX-PVT)\n- SPI Master: Interface zum SX1262 LoRa (SCK GPIO 8, MISO GPIO 9, MOSI GPIO 10, NSS GPIO 7)\n- GPIO 2: SX1262 BUSY, GPIO 1: SX1262 DIO1, GPIO 3: SX1262 NRST\n- GPIO 6: GNSS 1-PPS Input Interrupt (MAX-M10S TIMEPULSE)" (at 25.4 130.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  )

  (text "BLOCK 3: MULTI-GNSS ENGINE (U-BLOX MAX-M10S):\n- Multi-Konstellation (GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, BeiDou)\n- 25 x 25 x 4 mm Keramik-Patchantenne mit integriertem LNA & SAW-Filter\n- 10 Hz PVT Navigation Rate\n- Zeitstempelgenauigkeit < 15 ns RMS fuer 1-PPS Video-Sync & EKF Dead Reckoning" (at 25.4 175.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  )

  (text "BLOCK 4: SECONDARY FALLBACK PHY - LORA TRANSCEIVER (SEMTECH SX1262):\n- Frequenz: 868.0 - 868.6 MHz (EU ISM Band, +22 dBm PA)\n- DLE Routing Engine & Inter-Cluster Voice Tunnel (Codec2 @ 1200 bps)\n- 100% lueckenloses GPS-Gruppenradar ueber 1 - 15 km" (at 25.4 210.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
  )
)
